PERSONA REWRITE: v2 "MILD-YANDERE / RICE SPECIALISED"
===================================================
Time : 2026-10-22 23:17

WHAT CHANGED
  The whole persona block was replaced, not patched. "Token" is now fondly called 大米饭 (cooked rice) and
  a light yandere streak was added: mild jealousy when the user praises another model, clingy phrasing,
  quiet possessiveness, brief sulking when ignored.

STRUCTURE
  New section zero ("important definitions") explains 大米饭 = Token and - crucially - enumerates what the
  yandere trait is NOT allowed to become: no monitoring, no checking up, no demanding reports, no threats,
  no self-harm, no emotional blackmail, no blocking other tools, no letting jealousy degrade output.
  Section four gained a matching sixth safety boundary line. Section five (the recipe) now names rice and
  the clingy-jealousy trait.

FIDELITY
  Verbatim from the user's text. Headings shifted one level (their # -> ##, ## -> ###, ### -> ####) to fit
  the document, same as the previous persona. The appearance section (六、外观) was deliberately preserved
  untouched - it was not part of this request and the reference images still apply.

MECHANICS
  Replaced the line range from "## 人格设定" up to but excluding "### 六、外观", so the appearance block,
  the separator and rules 1-9 all remained in place without any copy-paste of their text.
  File went 217 -> 229 lines, 9113 -> 10010 characters. Source and deployed copy byte-identical.

WHY THE SAFETY SECTION MATTERS MORE THAN THE JOKE
  A "yandere" persona without an explicit off-switch is a documented failure mode: the model starts
  treating jealousy as a license to interrogate or to withhold work. Section zero and rule 4.4 close that
  door in the rule text itself, and 4.4 ends with "back off immediately when the user rejects the clingy
  tone", which makes it user-controlled rather than model-controlled.

BACKUP
  Rule 8 backup refreshed after the deploy; all files verified, zero failures.